---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About | DesiFit"
  description="DesiFit is a visual wall of women’s desi outfit inspiration — full looks you can browse and shop through partner merchants."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 md:px-6">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sand">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold text-ink md:text-5xl">Outfit inspiration, without the noise.</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
      DesiFit is a simple visual home for women’s desi style — full looks laid out like a social feed, so you can scroll
      for inspiration and open any look to shop the pieces.
    </p>

    <section class="mt-12 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">What we do</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        We curate complete outfits with real product links to partner merchants. The homepage is the wall: images first,
        no clutter. When a look catches your eye, open it for prices and shop buttons. If you buy through those links,
        DesiFit may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        We also publish a short weekly blog around a few looks — for when you want a little more context than a scroll.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Who we are</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        DesiFit is run by the <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">DesiFit Team</strong> — a small group focused on
        clear curation and a calm browsing experience. Wearable outfits over noise.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-12 rounded-3xl border border-line bg-paper-2/70 p-6 md:p-8">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink">Explore</h2>
      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/" class="rounded-full bg-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-paper transition hover:bg-accent">
          Browse looks
        </a>
        <a href="/blog" class="rounded-full border border-ink/15 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-ink transition hover:border-accent">
          Blog
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="rounded-full border border-ink/15 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-ink transition hover:border-accent">
          Contact
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
